    "detailed_description": "You play as a character who got into the Gulag. The Gulag was a place of detention in the years 1930-1960. The purpose of the camps was to use the labor force of persons serving sentences to colonize remote and unfavorable lands throughout the Soviet Union.<br><br><strong>&quot;Escape from GULAG&quot;</strong> is the maze game that increases difficulty as you progress through the levels. You need to find a way out of a complex network of mazes. On your way there will be squads of punishers who want to kill you. You can also choose your weapon, before starting the escape.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Scalable difficulty.<br></li><li>3 levels in Early Access. <br></li><li>Plans on adding trading cards, beautiful backgrounds and emoticons.</li></ul>",
